  "reason": "Evidence: config_001 (RNA-only, PCA-2000, singleprofile) achieves 0.485 acc, far outperforming both image-only models (~0.21-0.23), confirming RNA as the dominant signal. However, we have no evidence on whether a learned RNA encoder (scvi_n200) can capture non-linear structure that linear PCA misses. This experiment tests scvi_n200 with the same singleprofile setting as config_001, isolating the encoder choice as the only variable. If scvi improves accuracy, it opens a promising direction for subsequent multimodal and multiprofile experiments; if not, PCA is confirmed as sufficient and we can redirect budget toward aggregation/fusion strategies. With 6 experiments remaining, resolving the encoder question early is the highest-information single test."
}

